    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on thompson1917-ch17-15: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.94";
    dc:description "The phylogenetic prediction is explicit and can be tested with extensive independent fossil evidence and modern methods. Missing fossil data affect certainty but do not prevent a strong resolution of branch placement.";
