    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Test Parahippus placement using public morphological and molecularly calibrated total-evidence equid phylogenies, independently of its fit to a skull transformation. Topological support for or against direct ancestry resolves the historical inference.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Direct ancestry is harder to establish than sister-group placement.", "Fossil character matrices contain missing data.";
